# Cloudflare Pages redirects
#
# Canonicalize the www subdomain to the apex domain with a 301.
# GSC reported https://www.getskoolit.com/ and http://www.getskoolit.com/
# returning 403 (Blocked due to access forbidden) — Googlebot could not
# crawl the www host. This sends all www traffic to the apex domain, which
# already serves 200 and matches every <link rel="canonical"> on the site.
#
# IMPORTANT: For this rule to take effect, www.getskoolit.com must be added
# as a custom domain on the Cloudflare Pages project (Pages → skoolit-landing
# → Custom domains → Set up a domain → www.getskoolit.com). Until the host is
# registered, Pages rejects it with "host_not_allowed" before _redirects runs.
https://www.getskoolit.com/* https://getskoolit.com/:splat 301
